################################################################################
#
# PURPOSE:
#
#   Estimate and compare high-dimensional spatial dependence models using
#   TRAINING-PERIOD pseudo-observations only.
#
# PRIMARY MODEL:
#
#   Gaussian copula based on the empirical Gaussianized correlation matrix.
#
# SENSITIVITY MODEL:
#
#   Clayton copula estimated by maximum pseudo-likelihood when numerically
#   valid.
#
# IMPORTANT:
#
#   The Gaussian copula is represented by the custom object `gaussian_fit`.
#   It is NOT an S4 fitCopula object.
#
#   Therefore downstream calculations must use:
#
