        "vol_mat contains zero locations."
    )
}


# =============================================================================
# 17.1 VALIDATE GARCH SUMMARY STRUCTURE
# =============================================================================
#
# NOTE:
#
#   High_Persistence_Flag is NOT required to be produced by Section 16.
