#
# full_vol_mat:
#
#       n_days x n_loc
#
# Training rows:
#       estimated GARCH volatility
#
# Test rows:
#       NA
#
# IMPORTANT:
#
#   Section 18 DOES NOT:
#
#       - estimate GARCH models
